{"id":"a5264e1ed228195f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-epsilon-substitution.md","title":"Epsilon-substitution","display":"df-epsilon-substitution — Epsilon-substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-epsilon-substitution","aliases":["72-df-epsilon-substitution"],"display":"df-epsilon-substitution — Epsilon-substitution","depends_on":["[[72-df-epsilon-operator]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Book epsilon-method background; supplement Zach2017 §§2–3, explicit finite-substitution evaluation","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_kind":"supplementary-primary-or-local-derivation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-epsilon-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-epsilon-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-epsilon-substitution — Epsilon-substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e235e3c68d698c2\" href=\"?note=2e235e3c68d698c2\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-operator\">72-df-epsilon-operator</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Book epsilon-method background; supplement Zach2017 §§2–3, explicit finite-substitution evaluation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"supplementary-primary-or-local-derivation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>语法取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e235e3c68d698c2\" href=\"?note=2e235e3c68d698c2\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-operator\">72-df-epsilon-operator</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EpsClosed}\">\\(\\operatorname{EpsClosed}\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的有限部分函数；不在域内的ε项默认取0。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}_E\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}_E\\)</span> 对闭无量词项/公式按外部语法递归，遇ε项直接查E，不递归评价它的body。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是有限闭无量词critical-formula集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Crit}^0\">\\(\\operatorname{Crit}^0\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\operatorname{QFml}_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\operatorname{QFml}_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 中无自由变量的公式集。项的0、S、+、·及等号、小于、¬、→均在标准N解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\operatorname{EpsSub}\">\\(E\\in\\operatorname{EpsSub}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}_E\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}_E\\)</span> 的项输入限于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QTrm}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\{t:\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon(t)=\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{QTrm}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\{t:\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon(t)=\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>，公式输入限于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QFml}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\operatorname{QFml}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Crit}^{0}:=\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\operatorname{QFml}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Crit}^{0}:=\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\operatorname{QFml}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{EpsSub}&amp;:=\\{E\\subseteq\\operatorname{EpsClosed}\\times\\omega:|E|\\in\\omega\\land\\forall e\\in\\operatorname{EpsClosed}\\ \\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\ ((\\langle e,m\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle e,n\\rangle\\in E)\\to m=n)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(0)&amp;:=0,\\quad\\operatorname{ev}_E(St):=\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(t+u)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)+\\operatorname{ev}_E(u),\\quad\\operatorname{ev}_E(t\\cdot u):=\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)\\operatorname{ev}_E(u),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(e)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}E(e),&amp;e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(E),\\\\0,&amp;e\\in\\operatorname{EpsClosed}\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(E),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(t=u)&amp;:=\\mathbf1_{\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)=\\operatorname{ev}_E(u)},\\quad\\operatorname{ev}_E(t&lt;u):=\\mathbf1_{\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)&lt;\\operatorname{ev}_E(u)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(\\neg A)&amp;:=1-\\operatorname{ev}_E(A),\\quad\\operatorname{ev}_E(A\\to B):=\\max(1-\\operatorname{ev}_E(A),\\operatorname{ev}_E(B)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Correct}(E,C)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow E\\in\\operatorname{EpsSub}\\land C\\subseteq\\operatorname{Crit}^0\\land |C|&lt;\\omega\\land\\forall A\\in C\\ \\operatorname{ev}_E(A)=1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{EpsSub}&amp;:=\\{E\\subseteq\\operatorname{EpsClosed}\\times\\omega:|E|\\in\\omega\\land\\forall e\\in\\operatorname{EpsClosed}\\ \\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\ ((\\langle e,m\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle e,n\\rangle\\in E)\\to m=n)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(0)&amp;:=0,\\quad\\operatorname{ev}_E(St):=\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(t+u)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)+\\operatorname{ev}_E(u),\\quad\\operatorname{ev}_E(t\\cdot u):=\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)\\operatorname{ev}_E(u),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(e)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}E(e),&amp;e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(E),\\\\0,&amp;e\\in\\operatorname{EpsClosed}\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(E),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(t=u)&amp;:=\\mathbf1_{\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)=\\operatorname{ev}_E(u)},\\quad\\operatorname{ev}_E(t&lt;u):=\\mathbf1_{\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)&lt;\\operatorname{ev}_E(u)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(\\neg A)&amp;:=1-\\operatorname{ev}_E(A),\\quad\\operatorname{ev}_E(A\\to B):=\\max(1-\\operatorname{ev}_E(A),\\operatorname{ev}_E(B)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Correct}(E,C)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow E\\in\\operatorname{EpsSub}\\land C\\subseteq\\operatorname{Crit}^0\\land |C|&lt;\\omega\\land\\forall A\\in C\\ \\operatorname{ev}_E(A)=1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>替换正确性是计算后有限组critical formulas都真，不是自指的“每个ε项自动取满足body的最小数”。此处明确有限替换、缺省0及求值域。它尚未定义Hilbert的H-process更新算法；因此后续存在正确替换的语义论证不能被写成该算法已终止。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-epsilon-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2e235e3c68d698c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-epsilon-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2e235e3c68d698c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语法取 [[72-df-epsilon-operator]]。$E$ 为 $\\operatorname{EpsClosed}$ 到 $\\omega$ 的有限部分函数；不在域内的ε项默认取0。$\\operatorname{ev}_E$ 对闭无量词项/公式按外部语法递归，遇ε项直接查E，不递归评价它的body。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EpsClosed}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}_E","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Crit}^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\operatorname{QFml}_\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"E\\in\\operatorname{EpsSub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QTrm}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\{t:\\operatorname{FV}_\\varepsilon(t)=\\varnothing\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QFml}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Crit}^{0}:=\\operatorname{Crit}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\operatorname{QFml}_\\varepsilon\\cap\\operatorname{Sent}_\\varepsilon.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{EpsSub}&:=\\{E\\subseteq\\operatorname{EpsClosed}\\times\\omega:|E|\\in\\omega\\land\\forall e\\in\\operatorname{EpsClosed}\\ \\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\ ((\\langle e,m\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle e,n\\rangle\\in E)\\to m=n)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(0)&:=0,\\quad\\operatorname{ev}_E(St):=\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(t+u)&:=\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)+\\operatorname{ev}_E(u),\\quad\\operatorname{ev}_E(t\\cdot u):=\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)\\operatorname{ev}_E(u),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(e)&:=\\begin{cases}E(e),&e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(E),\\\\0,&e\\in\\operatorname{EpsClosed}\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(E),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(t=u)&:=\\mathbf1_{\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)=\\operatorname{ev}_E(u)},\\quad\\operatorname{ev}_E(t<u):=\\mathbf1_{\\operatorname{ev}_E(t)<\\operatorname{ev}_E(u)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_E(\\neg A)&:=1-\\operatorname{ev}_E(A),\\quad\\operatorname{ev}_E(A\\to B):=\\max(1-\\operatorname{ev}_E(A),\\operatorname{ev}_E(B)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Correct}(E,C)&:\\Longleftrightarrow E\\in\\operatorname{EpsSub}\\land C\\subseteq\\operatorname{Crit}^0\\land |C|<\\omega\\land\\forall A\\in C\\ \\operatorname{ev}_E(A)=1.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3066,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-substitution|df-epsilon-substitution — Epsilon-substitution]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-epsilon-substitution|df-epsilon-substitution — Epsilon-substitution]]"},{"id":"7b9fccf57e0fe915","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Crit}^0,\\operatorname{Correct}$ 取 [[72-df-epsilon-substitution]]；$\\mathsf{PA}_\\varepsilon,\\vdash_\\varepsilon,J_\\varepsilon,\\operatorname{Con}_\\varepsilon$ 取 [[72-df-epsilon-arithmetic]]。$\\mathsf{PA},\\vdash_2$ 分别取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]、[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]。$\\operatorname{Sent}_1:=\\operatorname{Fml}_1(\\varnothing)\\cap\\operatorname{Sent}_2(\\varnothing)$，两语言之间不作隐式同一化。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-epsilon-substitution|72-df-epsilon-substitution]]"}],"outgoing":["2e235e3c68d698c2"]}